    gmeow:useWhen "Use to check the declared binding or numeric boundary on its own supplied reading record."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:avoidWhen "Avoid treating this intrinsic law as an executed reader, authenticated receipt or digest verification."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:howToUse "Retain actual source values and evaluate the canonical law in the selected interpretation."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:scopeNote "The graph-term digest join preserves original literal identity. Statement-component lowering must be complete; no lexical matcher, chronology selector or native digest validator is supplied."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:example "gmeow:RestatementAnnotationContractConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:restatementRun ."@x-gmeow-english ;
    logic:formalizes gmeow:restatementRun ; logic:message "Every supplied restatement measurement or receipt/version annotation binds to its own possible wasDerivedFrom reifier, retained source texts, reader, complete measurement fields and the actual immutable parameter release carrying the identical digest term; it carries no confidence or numeric credence."@x-gmeow-english ;
